  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The proposed first-floor extension and associated alterations to the roof form of the dwellinghouse, would result in an obtrusive, disproportionate, and incongruous addition to the original dwellinghouse, unbalancing the pair of semi-detached properties that the site forms part of, and would erode the architectural character of both the original dwellinghouse and the streetscape via the loss of the catslide roof form. The proposal would thereby be contrary to the high quality design aspirations of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policy D3 of The London Plan (2021), Core Policy CS1.B of the Harrow Core Strategy (2012), Policy DM1 of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013) and the adopted London Borough of Harrow Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010)."
